The components in this directory (src/components/ui/) are adapted from
shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com), which is itself built on Radix UI
primitives (https://www.radix-ui.com, also MIT). shadcn/ui is distributed as
source you copy into your own project rather than as an installed package, so
this file carries the license forward per its terms, as this PR's copy is
adapted by hand rather than fetched by the `shadcn` CLI.
